#include? "Pods/Target Support Files/Pods-Runner/Pods-Runner.debug.xcconfig"
#include "Generated.xcconfig"

// Where a debug build on a device points, and why it lives here.
//
// `--dart-define` values reach an Xcode build through DART_DEFINES in
// Generated.xcconfig — a file Flutter rewrites, including when Xcode itself
// runs the build. So a build configured from the command line and then started
// with Xcode's Run button silently loses its defines and falls back to the
// in-app mock backend: the seeded demo account signs in, a real account is
// rejected as "wrong email or password", and nothing about the failure points
// at the cause.
//
// This file is checked in and Flutter never rewrites it, so the values survive.
// `$(inherited)` keeps Flutter's own defines from the include above.
//
// Debug only. A release build sends bearer tokens over TLS or not at all
// (docs/07-SECURITY.md §2), so it has no business pointing at a plain-HTTP
// address on anyone's desk.
//
// Two lines, because the two destinations need different addresses and the
// device one goes stale.
//
// A simulator shares this Mac's network stack, so 127.0.0.1 is the API and
// always will be — it survives changing Wi-Fi, moving desk, and a DHCP lease
// expiring overnight. A phone does not: it needs the address this Mac has on
// the network they share, which changes, and when it does the app hangs on a
// loading spinner with nothing to say why. That happened during a demo, and
// `./wordos status` is the thing that tells you.
//
// `[sdk=...]` is an xcconfig conditional — Xcode picks the matching line — so
// `./wordos ip` now rewrites only the device one and the simulator is never
// broken by a network change.
//
// Decoded:
//   iphonesimulator → WORDOS_MOCK=false, WORDOS_API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:5199/api
//   iphoneos        → WORDOS_MOCK=false, WORDOS_API_BASE_URL=http://192.168.1.152:5199/api
DART_DEFINES[sdk=iphonesimulator*]=$(inherited),V09SRE9TX01PQ0s9ZmFsc2U=,V09SRE9TX0FQSV9CQVNFX1VSTD1odHRwOi8vMTI3LjAuMC4xOjUxOTkvYXBp
DART_DEFINES[sdk=iphoneos*]=$(inherited),V09SRE9TX01PQ0s9ZmFsc2U=,V09SRE9TX0FQSV9CQVNFX1VSTD1odHRwOi8vMTkyLjE2OC4xLjE1Mjo1MTk5L2FwaQ==
